Summary → takeaways → reasoning → evidence",fillcolor="#eee6fa"];
 EP [label="EARLY · One hard DS slice\nAccount → plan → actual short draft\nUseful enough to expand?",fillcolor="#ffedc9",shape=diamond];
 EN [label="If not: repair / narrow account\nor expose human writing dependency\nIndependent cleanup continues",fillcolor="#fff4df"];
